<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S5.SS2.SSS4" title="In V-B General Case: K≥1 ‣ V Proposed Algorithms ‣ SlimCaching: Edge Caching of Mixture-of-Experts for Distributed Inference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">V-B</span>4 </span>The proposed accelerated algorithm</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S5.SS2.SSS5" title="In V-B General Case: K≥1 ‣ V Proposed Algorithms ‣ SlimCaching: Edge Caching of Mixture-of-Experts for Distributed Inference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">V-B</span>5 </span>Computational complexity</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S5.SS2.SSS6" title="In V-B General Case: K≥1 ‣ V Proposed Algorithms ‣ SlimCaching: Edge Caching of Mixture-of-Experts for Distributed Inference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">V-B</span>6 </span>Approximation guarantee</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS3" title="In V Proposed Algorithms ‣ SlimCaching: Edge Caching of Mixture-of-Experts for Distributed Inference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">V-C</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Discussion of Proposed Algorithm and Solutions</span></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
